OL,3,GNEWSATop Gear star thanks 999 crews on
OL,4,Acrash anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Top Gear presenter Richard
OL,7,FHammond has thanked emergency services
OL,8,Ffor their help on the 20th anniversary
OL,9,Fof the crash in which he was nearly
OL,10,Fkilled.
OL,12,FHammond was seriously injured in
OL,13,FSeptember 2006 when the 320mph
OL,14,F(515km/h) jet-powered Vampire dragster
OL,15,Fhe was driving veered off the track at
OL,16,FElvington airfield, near York, during
OL,17,Ffilming for the BBC show.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
