OL,3,GNEWSATop Gear star thanks 999 crews on
OL,4,Acrash anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an Instagram post, Hammond said he
OL,7,Fwanted to thank the members of the
OL,8,Fstaff who rescued him and supported him
OL,9,Ffollowing the accident "from the bottom
OL,10,Fof my heart".
OL,12,FIn the post, he spoke of the events of
OL,13,Fthat day and said he would be "forever
OL,14,Fgrateful" to all those who helped him
OL,15,Fin the aftermath of the crash.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
